</mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.363em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msup></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>:</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo>∪</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo>⊆</mo><msup><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">R</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></msup></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span>. What bound does <span class=\"citation\" data-cites=\"thm-caratheodory\">@thm-caratheodory</span>\ngive, and what bound does (b) give?</li>\n</ol>\n</div>","file":"ch18-convexity/02-caratheodory.html"}